msgid "Servo Gimbal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:10
#: 582fe9338e284460ac924a753b0635a7
msgid "ArduPilot can stabilize a servo gimbal with up to three axis of motion using any of the free PWM output channels. Once connected the camera gimbal can be controlled by the pilot using an RC transmitter, by sending commands from the ground stations or autonomously during missions"
msgstr ""

